  "summary": "Fill in a Sudoku puzzle.",
  "statement": "`board` is 9 strings of 9 characters (`1-9` or `.` for empty). Fill the empty cells so every row, column and\n3\u00d73 box contains the digits 1-9 exactly once. The puzzle has exactly one solution. Return the solved board.",
  "constraints": [
    "board is 9 x 9",
    "exactly one solution"
  ],
  "examples": [
